mobs.description:
If you hail her at level 18:

{{Chat|say|Hail, Miral the Dark Elf.|Deep Common}}
{{Chat|Miral the Dark Elf|Karzzul. You are another bounty hunter or you looking to volunteer?}}
{{Chat|say|I am looking to volunteer.|Deep Common}}
{{Chat|Miral the Dark Elf|You look a bit green for what i have planned. ask me again once you've survived a few more.....well, a lot more battles.}}
{{Chat|say|I am a bounty hunter.|Deep Common}}
{{Chat|Miral the Dark Elf|They're always sending fools to kill me. I make some decent pocket change selling their corpses to Esveth.}}

Area Keying Spoiler
{{spoiler|Used for the keying quest of [[Glinting Hollow]]<br>
Turn in [[Fresh Squirrel Meat]] (Even while KOS, agroing wolves around him causes him to agro)<br>
This causes Treants and Wolves in the area to drop [[Glinting Scale of Nature]] which acts as a key to the next area. Side note, if you kill Softpaw then the event dies and the keys won't drop.<br>
Proceeding down the cave that Softpaws appears in while holding [[Glinting Scale of Nature]] will cause you to move to the next area.
}}
